      "name": "The Old Rule Is Gone",
      "char_file": "사랑니_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Dentists used to pull wisdom",
        "teeth out just as a precaution",
        "",
        "Current guidance says",
        "that's not automatic anymore —",
        "two signs actually decide it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Sign 1: The Gum Flap Trap",
      "char_file": "잇몸출혈_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "A flap of gum often covers",
        "part of an emerging tooth,",
        "trapping food and bacteria",
        "",
        "That's pericoronitis —",
        "throbbing pain, bad breath,",
        "and red, swollen gums"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Sign 2: Growing In Tilted",
      "char_file": "턱관절_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "When a tooth leans",
        "on the molar next to it",
        "",
        "That pressure wears down",
        "the neighboring root and",
        "opens a gap for cavities"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "When You Can Just Watch It",
      "char_file": "치실_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "No infection, a clean bite,",
        "easy to brush around?",
        "",
        "Regular dental checkups",
        "are all you need"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "When Removal Is the Call",
      "char_file": "사랑니_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Recurring infection, or damage",
        "to the tooth beside it —",
        "either one tips the decision",
        "",
        "It's simplest in your",
        "early twenties, while healing is fast"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "While You Wait It Out",
      "char_file": "소금_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Warm salt water rinses and a",
        "cold compress for 20 minutes",
        "take the edge off",
        "",
        "Pain past a day or two?",
        "Trouble opening your mouth?",
        "Get seen, don't ride it out"
      ]
    }
